><b class="tabular-nums">5</b> <span class="text-muted-foreground">other</span></span></p><p class="m-0 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Grouped by tool name. At most: moves money, runs code or commands, deletes data, or sends messages for you.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-3 rounded-xl bg-foreground/[0.035] p-5"><h2 class="m-0 text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-[0.07em] text-muted-foreground uppercase">What it costs</h2><span class="text-[26px] leading-none font-bold">Free</span><p class="m-0 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Odel charges nothing per call. The publisher may charge for its own service.</p></div></div></section><section id="tools" aria-labelledby="tools-title" class="flex scroll-mt-28 flex-col gap-4 rounded-xl border bg-card p-5 sm:p-6"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-3 gap-y-1"><h2 id="tools-title" class="m-0 text-lg font-semibold">Tools</h2><span class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">13<!-- --> · grouped by tool name<!-- --> · checked 8 Nov 2026</span></div><div class="relative"><div class="flex flex-col gap-5 max-h-80 overflow-hidden"><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><h3 class="m-0 flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold"><span class="size-2.5 rounded-[3px] bg-accent-5" aria-hidden="true"></span>Read<!-- --> · <!-- -->2<span class="font-normal text-muted-foreground">Look things up</span></h3><ul class="m-0 grid list-none gap-2 p-0 sm:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-3"><li title="market_search" class="truncate rounded-md bg-foreground/[0.05] px-2.5 py-1.5 font-mono text-[13px] text-foreground">market_search</li><li title="x402_check" class="truncate rounded-md bg-foreground/[0.05] px-2.5 py-1.5 font-mono text-[13px] text-foreground">x402_check</li></ul></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><h3 class="m-0 flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold"><span class="size-2.5 rounded-[3px] bg-accent-6" aria-hidden="true"></span>Act<!-- --> · <!-- -->6<span class="font-normal text-muted-foreground">Change something</span></h3><ul class="m-0 grid list-none gap-2 p-0 sm:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-3"><li title="market_invoke" class="truncate rounded-md bg-foreground/[0.05] px-2.5 py-1.5 font-mono text-[13px] text-foreground">market_invoke</li><li title="pipeline_prepare" class="truncate rounded-md bg-foreground/[0.05] px-2.5 py-1.5 font-mono text-[13px] text-foreground">pipeline_prepare</li><li title="pipeline_invoke" class="truncate rounded-md bg-foreground/[0.05] px-2.5 py-1.5 font-mono text-[13px] text-foreground">pipeline_invoke</li><li title="pipeline_refund_prepare" class="truncate rounded-md bg-foreground/[0.05] px-2.5 py-1.5 font-mono text-[13px] text-foreground">pipeline_refund_prepare</li><li title="pipeline_refund" class="truncate rounded-md bg-foreground/[0.05] px-2.5 py-1.5 font-mono text-[13px] text-foreground">pipeline_refund</li><li title="pipeline_refund_status" class="truncate rounded-md bg-foreground/[0.05] px-2.5 py-1.5 font-mono text-[13px] text-foreground">pipeline_refund_status</li></ul></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><h3 class="m-0 flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold"><span class="size-2.5 rounded-[3px] bg-muted-foreground/40" aria-hidden="true"></span>Other<!-- --> · <!-- -->5<span class="font-normal text-muted-foreground">Neither hinted nor named</span></h3><ul class="m-0 grid list-none gap-2 p-0 sm:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-3"><li title="pipeline_status" class="truncate rounded-md bg-foreground/[0.05] px-2.5 py-1.5 font-mono text-[13px] text-foreground">pipeline_status</li><li title="weather_now" class="truncate rounded-md bg-foreground/[0.05] px-2.5 py-1.5 font-mono text-[13px] text-foreground">weather_now</li><li title="air_quality_now" class="truncate rounded-md bg-foreground/[0.05] px-2.5 py-1.5 font-mono text-[13px] text-foreground">air_quality_now</li><li title="nearby_sensors" class="truncate rounded-md bg-foreground/[0.05] px-2.5 py-1.5 font-mono text-[13px] text-foreground">nearby_sensors</li><li title="fair_random" class="truncate rounded-md bg-foreground/[0.05] px-2.5 py-1.5 font-mono text-[13px] text-foreground">fair_random</li></ul></div></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-20 bg-gradient-to-t from-card" aria-hidden="true"></div></div><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2"><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-md border px-3 py-1.5 text-sm font-medium transition-colors hover:bg-accent">Show all 13 tools</button><button type="button" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-md border px-3 py-1.5 text-sm font-medium transition-colors hover:bg-accent"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-refresh-cw size-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 12a9 9 0 0 1 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 1 6.74 2.74L21 8"></path><path d="M21 3v5h-5"></path><path d="M21 12a9 9 0 0 1-9 9 9.75 9.75 0 0 1-6.74-2.74L3 16"></path><path d="M8 16H3v5"></path></svg>Check details live</button><a href="https://dev.odel.app/inspector?url=https%3A%2F%2Fhub.attestedmemory.net%2Fmcp" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-md border px-3 py-1.5 text-sm font-medium transition-colors hover:bg-accent">Try it in the Inspector<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-external-link size-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 3h6v6"></path><path d="M10 14 21 3"></path><path d="M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"></path></svg></a></div></section><section id="readme" aria-label="README" class="scroll-mt-28 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border bg-card"><div class="relative flex items-center gap-3 border-b bg-background-dark/60 px-4 py-2.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-book-open size-4 text-muted-foreground" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 7v14"></path><path d="M3 18a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 4 4 0 0 1 4-4h5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v13a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-6a3 3 0 0 0-3 3 3 3 0 0 0-3-3z"></path></svg><span class="text-sm font-semibold">README</span><span class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">4<!-- --> min read</span><span class="flex-1"></span><a href="https://github.com/alexar76/attested-memory#readme" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" class="inline-flex h-8 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-md border px-2.5 text-[13px] font-medium transition-colors hover:bg-accent"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" class="size-3.5"><path d="M12 .297c-6.63 0-12 5.373-12 12 0 5.303 3.438 9.8 8.205 11.385.6.113.82-.258.82-.577 0-.285-.01-1.04-.015-2.04-3.338.724-4.042-1.61-4.042-1.61-.546-1.387-1.333-1.756-1.333-1.756-1.089-.745.083-.729.083-.729 1.205.084 1.839 1.237 1.839 1.237 1.07 1.834 2.807 1.304 3.492.997.108-.775.418-1.305.762-1.604-2.665-.305-5.467-1.334-5.467-5.931 0-1.311.469-2.381 1.236-3.221-.124-.303-.535-1.524.117-3.176 0 0 1.008-.322 3.301 1.23A11.509 11.509 0 0 1 12 5.803c1.02.005 2.047.138 3.006.404 2.291-1.552 3.297-1.23 3.297-1.23.653 1.653.242 2.874.118 3.176.77.84 1.235 1.911 1.235 3.221 0 4.609-2.807 5.624-5.479 5.921.43.372.823 1.102.823 2.222 0 1.606-.014 2.898-.014 3.293 0 .322.216.694.825.576C20.565 22.092 24 17.592 24 12.297c0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12"></path></svg><span class="hidden sm:inline">View on GitHub</span></a></div><div class="relative"><div class="px-5 pt-6 pb-2 sm:px-8 sm:pt-7 max-h-[56rem] overflow-hidden"><div class="markdown-content min-w-0 prose max-w-none">
